{"name": "finish", "arguments": {"beliefs": {"T1": "uncertain", "T2": "uncertain"}, "recommendation": "Do not commit to a differentiated consumer proposition yet. Jotun already serves individual buyers directly and has a marine protection reputation, but demand for marine protection and willingness to pay a premium are not proven. The softness of decorative paint demand in Scandinavia adds uncertainty. Run the proposed digital messaging test to measure actual consumer response before investing in a consumer-focused",
