"uncertainty": "The size of the individual marine protection market and whether consumers will pay a premium for Jotun products are unknown. The softness of decorative paint demand in Scandinavia also introduces uncertainty.", "would_change_if": ["If the digital messaging test shows Version B (decorative design) outperforms Version A by at least 5 percentage points in CTR and conversion rate, the recommendation would shift to a consumer proposition focused on decorative design.", "If the test shows neither version outperforms the other by the required margin, the recommendation would remain to maintain the current B2B focus."], "evidence_ids": ["jotun-boatnews-direct", "jotun-pci-diy", "jotun-pci-yachts", "jotun-q1-2024-soft"]}}
